(function(E){ const x = E["exam-10"] = E["exam-10"] || {units:{}}; (x.units = x.units || {})["x10-l1"] = {"id":"x10-l1","patterns":["L1-jobs","PARA-money","PARA-time","TR-number","TR-spell","TR-selfcorrect","TR-price","TR-paraphrase"],"title":{"en":"Listening Part 1: a first day at work","tr":"Listening Part 1: işte ilk gün","fa":"Listening Part 1: روز اول کار"},"objective":{"en":"In this lesson you will learn to complete notes and then a table while a supervisor explains a new job: catch corrected numbers, choose the figure for the right item, and write only what the gap needs.","tr":"Bu derste bir amir yeni bir işi anlatırken önce notları, sonra bir tabloyu tamamlamayı öğreneceksin: düzeltilen sayıları yakalayacak, doğru ürüne ait rakamı seçecek ve yalnızca boşluğun istediğini yazacaksın.","fa":"در این درس یاد می‌گیری وقتی یک سرپرست کار تازه‌ای را توضیح می‌دهد، اول یادداشت‌ها و بعد یک جدول را کامل کنی: عددهای اصلاح‌شده را بگیری، عددِ مربوط به چیز درست را انتخاب کنی و فقط چیزی را بنویسی که جای خالی می‌خواهد."},"sessions":[["explain"],["drill"],["exit"]],"explain":{"title":{"en":"Listening Part 1: a first day at work","tr":"Listening Part 1: işte ilk gün","fa":"Listening Part 1: روز اول کار"},"objective":{"en":"In this lesson you will learn to complete notes and then a table while a supervisor explains a new job: catch corrected numbers, choose the figure for the right item, and write only what the gap needs.","tr":"Bu derste bir amir yeni bir işi anlatırken önce notları, sonra bir tabloyu tamamlamayı öğreneceksin: düzeltilen sayıları yakalayacak, doğru ürüne ait rakamı seçecek ve yalnızca boşluğun istediğini yazacaksın.","fa":"در این درس یاد می‌گیری وقتی یک سرپرست کار تازه‌ای را توضیح می‌دهد، اول یادداشت‌ها و بعد یک جدول را کامل کنی: عددهای اصلاح‌شده را بگیری، عددِ مربوط به چیز درست را انتخاب کنی و فقط چیزی را بنویسی که جای خالی می‌خواهد."},"stats":[{"label":{"en":"Questions","tr":"Soru","fa":"سؤال"},"value":"10"},{"label":{"en":"Speakers","tr":"Konuşan","fa":"گوینده"},"value":"2"},{"label":{"en":"Word limit","tr":"Kelime sınırı","fa":"سقف کلمه"},"value":{"en":"1 word / number, then 1 word","tr":"1 kelime / sayı, sonra 1 kelime","fa":"۱ کلمه / عدد، بعد ۱ کلمه"}}],"context":{"eyebrow":{"en":"1 The context","tr":"1 Bağlam","fa":"۱ بافت"},"head":{"en":"This exam: starting at a garden centre","tr":"Bu sınav: bir bahçe merkezinde işe başlamak","fa":"این آزمون: شروع کار در یک مرکز باغبانی"},"intro":{"en":"Jobs, agencies and first days at work are among the most frequent Part 1 situations. The speaker gives lots of practical rules, and the newcomer often repeats them, which helps you check.","tr":"İşler, iş ajansları ve işte ilk gün, Part 1’de en sık çıkan durumlar arasındadır. Konuşan çok sayıda pratik kural verir ve yeni gelen çoğu zaman bunları tekrar eder; bu da kontrol etmene yardım eder.","fa":"شغل، آژانس کاریابی و روز اول کار از پرتکرارترین موقعیت‌های Part 1 هستند. گوینده قانون‌های عملی زیادی می‌گوید و تازه‌وارد اغلب تکرارشان می‌کند که برای چک کردن کمکت می‌کند."},"technique":{"en":"2 The technique","tr":"2 Teknik","fa":"۲ تکنیک"},"labels":{"asks":{"en":"What this part is about","tr":"Bu kısım ne hakkında","fa":"این بخش درباره‌ی چیست"},"fields":{"en":"Headings you will see","tr":"Göreceğin başlıklar","fa":"عنوان‌هایی که می‌بینی"},"words":{"en":"Words that carry the answers","tr":"Cevabı taşıyan kelimeler","fa":"کلمه‌هایی که جواب را می‌آورند"},"a":{"en":"On the paper","tr":"Kâğıtta","fa":"روی برگه"},"b":{"en":"What you hear or read","tr":"Duyduğun ya da okuduğun","fa":"چیزی که می‌شنوی یا می‌خوانی"},"traps":{"en":"Traps","tr":"Tuzaklar","fa":"دام‌ها"},"example":{"en":"Example","tr":"Örnek","fa":"نمونه"},"ideas":{"en":"Ideas","tr":"Fikirler","fa":"ایده‌ها"}},"cards":[{"id":"x10-l1-ctx","exam":true,"patterns":["L1-jobs","PARA-money","PARA-time"],"often":{"pattern":"L1-jobs","n":7,"of":40,"label":{"en":"Comes up often in the real exam: 7 of the last 40 tests","tr":"Gerçek sınavda sık çıkar: son 40 sınavın 7’sinde","fa":"در آزمون واقعی زیاد می‌آید: در ۷ آزمون از ۴۰ آزمونِ اخیر"}},"title":{"en":"A first day at work","tr":"İşte ilk gün","fa":"روز اول کار"},"asks":{"en":"A supervisor welcomes a new employee and explains the practical things (parking, lockers, paperwork, uniform, discounts, breaks), then describes the different areas of the workplace and what the newcomer will do in each. Notes come first, then a table.","tr":"Bir amir yeni bir çalışanı karşılıyor ve pratik konuları (park, dolaplar, evraklar, üniforma, indirimler, molalar) anlatıyor, sonra iş yerinin farklı bölümlerini ve yeni gelenin her birinde ne yapacağını açıklıyor. Önce notlar, sonra bir tablo geliyor.","fa":"یک سرپرست به کارمند تازه خوش‌آمد می‌گوید و چیزهای عملی را توضیح می‌دهد (پارکینگ، کمد، مدارک، یونیفرم، تخفیف، استراحت) و بعد بخش‌های مختلف محل کار و کار تازه‌وارد در هرکدام را شرح می‌دهد. اول یادداشت‌ها، بعد یک جدول."},"fields":["Parking","Locker","Documents","Uniform","Discount","Breaks","Areas: location and main task"],"words":[{"a":"staff","b":"employees / the team / people who work here","tr":"personel","fa":"کارکنان"},{"a":"round the back","b":"behind the building / at the rear","tr":"arka tarafta","fa":"پشت ساختمان"},{"a":"code","b":"the number you key in / PIN","tr":"şifre, kod","fa":"رمز"},{"a":"paperwork","b":"forms / documents to complete","tr":"evrak işleri","fa":"کاغذبازی، مدارک"},{"a":"proof of identity","b":"passport / ID card","tr":"kimlik belgesi","fa":"مدرک شناسایی"},{"a":"provided","b":"you’ll get / it’s in your locker","tr":"sağlanır","fa":"داده می‌شود"},{"a":"your own","b":"you need to bring / buy yourself","tr":"kendi ... n","fa":"مال خودت"},{"a":"discount","b":"money off / ... per cent off","tr":"indirim","fa":"تخفیف"},{"a":"a break","b":"time off during the shift","tr":"mola","fa":"استراحت"},{"a":"main task","b":"your main job there / what we need is","tr":"ana görev","fa":"کار اصلی"},{"a":"at busy times","b":"when it’s really busy / at weekends","tr":"yoğun zamanlarda","fa":"در ساعت‌های شلوغ"},{"a":"the hardest part","b":"what new staff find most difficult","tr":"en zor kısım","fa":"سخت‌ترین بخش"}],"traps":[{"en":"A code or number is corrected: \"four, seven, one, nine... wait, no, that’s the old one.\" Write the new one, as figures.","tr":"Bir kod ya da sayı düzeltilir: \"dört, yedi, bir, dokuz... dur, hayır, o eski.\" Yenisini rakamla yaz.","fa":"یک رمز یا عدد اصلاح می‌شود: «چهار، هفت، یک، نه... صبر کن، نه، آن قدیمی است». تازه را با رقم بنویس."},{"en":"Two figures for two kinds of item: \"five per cent on drinks, but on food it’s ten.\" Check which one the gap asks about.","tr":"İki tür ürün için iki rakam: \"içeceklerde yüzde beş ama yiyecekte on.\" Boşluğun hangisini sorduğuna bak.","fa":"دو عدد برای دو نوع کالا: «روی نوشیدنی پنج درصد، اما روی غذا ده». ببین جای خالی کدام را می‌خواهد."},{"en":"A task is ruled out before the real one: \"You won’t be cooking or serving... What we need is...\" The answer comes after \"what we need is\".","tr":"Asıl görevden önce başka bir görev elenir: \"Yemek yapmayacak ya da servis etmeyeceksin... İhtiyacımız olan...\" Cevap \"what we need is\"den sonra gelir.","fa":"قبل از کار اصلی، کار دیگری رد می‌شود: «آشپزی یا سرو نمی‌کنی... چیزی که لازم داریم...». جواب بعد از «what we need is» می‌آید."}],"example":{"lines":[["Supervisor","You’ll need to bring a photo for your staff card. Not a passport photo, actually. Any clear picture of your face will do."]],"item":"Bring a ___ for the staff card","answer":"photo","why":{"en":"\"Passport photo\" is ruled out (\"not... actually\"); one word: photo.","tr":"\"Vesikalık fotoğraf\" eleniyor (\"aslında... değil\"); tek kelime: photo.","fa":"«عکس پاسپورتی» رد می‌شود («در واقع... نه»)؛ یک کلمه: photo."}}},{"id":"L1-jobs","ctx":["L1-jobs"],"title":{"en":"A job, an agency or a training scheme","tr":"Bir iş, bir iş bulma ajansı ya da eğitim programı","fa":"کار، آژانس کاریابی یا دوره‌ی آموزشی"},"asks":{"en":"A caller registers with an agency, asks about a job or a training scheme, or gets the details for a first day at work. The notes collect personal details and the job: place, duties, hours, pay and requirements.","tr":"Arayan bir ajansa kaydolur, bir iş ya da eğitim programı hakkında bilgi alır ya da işteki ilk gününün ayrıntılarını öğrenir. Notlar kişisel bilgileri ve işi toplar: yer, görevler, saatler, ücret ve gereklilikler.","fa":"تماس‌گیرنده در یک آژانس ثبت‌نام می‌کند، درباره‌ی یک کار یا دوره‌ی آموزشی می‌پرسد، یا جزئیات اولین روز کارش را می‌گیرد. یادداشت‌ها مشخصات شخصی و کار را جمع می‌کنند: محل، وظایف، ساعت‌ها، دستمزد و شرایط لازم."},"fields":["Surname","Postcode","Date available","Experience","Type of work","Location","Hours / shift","Pay per hour","Requirements","Start date"],"words":[{"a":"experience","b":"I've worked as / for the last two years I've","tr":"deneyim","fa":"سابقه‌ی کار"},{"a":"available from","b":"I could start on","tr":"şu tarihten itibaren müsait","fa":"آماده‌ی کار از"},{"a":"duties","b":"you'd be responsible for / the main job is","tr":"görevler","fa":"وظایف"},{"a":"shift","b":"you'd work from six till two","tr":"vardiya","fa":"شیفت"},{"a":"per hour","b":"an hourly rate of","tr":"saat başına","fa":"ساعتی"},{"a":"requirements","b":"you'll need / you must have","tr":"gereklilikler","fa":"شرایط لازم"},{"a":"reference","b":"someone who can recommend you","tr":"referans","fa":"معرف"},{"a":"interview","b":"we'd like to see you on","tr":"mülakat","fa":"مصاحبه"},{"a":"uniform","b":"we give you a shirt / you wear","tr":"üniforma","fa":"لباس فرم"},{"a":"training","b":"a short course before you start","tr":"eğitim","fa":"آموزش"},{"a":"part-time","b":"a couple of days a week","tr":"yarı zamanlı","fa":"پاره‌وقت"},{"a":"certificate","b":"a qualification in","tr":"sertifika","fa":"گواهی‌نامه"},{"a":"supervisor","b":"the person in charge of your team","tr":"süpervizör, sorumlu","fa":"سرپرست"}],"traps":[{"en":"The caller gives an old address, number or date first and then corrects it.","tr":"Arayan önce eski bir adres, numara ya da tarih verir, sonra düzeltir.","fa":"تماس‌گیرنده اول یک آدرس، شماره یا تاریخ قدیمی می‌دهد و بعد اصلاحش می‌کند."},{"en":"Pay: the speaker may give several rates (weekdays, weekends, after training). Match the rate to the heading.","tr":"Ücret: konuşan birkaç ücret söyleyebilir (hafta içi, hafta sonu, eğitimden sonra). Ücreti başlıkla eşleştir.","fa":"دستمزد: گوینده ممکن است چند نرخ بگوید (روزهای کاری، آخر هفته، بعد از آموزش). نرخ را با عنوان جور کن."},{"en":"Experience: a job the caller did in the past is not the job they do now. Check the tense.","tr":"Deneyim: arayanın geçmişte yaptığı iş, şimdi yaptığı iş değildir. Zamana dikkat et.","fa":"سابقه: کاری که تماس‌گیرنده قبلاً می‌کرد با کار فعلی‌اش فرق دارد. به زمان فعل دقت کن."}],"example":{"lines":[["Adviser","Where would you prefer to work?"],["Caller","Somewhere central. I thought about the airport, but it’s too far."],["Adviser","We have a hotel near the station."],["Caller","The station would be perfect."]],"item":"Preferred location: near the ___","answer":"station","why":{"en":"The airport is mentioned and rejected. The caller accepts the hotel near the station.","tr":"Havalimanı söyleniyor ama reddediliyor. Arayan istasyonun yanındaki oteli kabul ediyor.","fa":"فرودگاه گفته می‌شود و رد می‌شود. تماس‌گیرنده هتل نزدیک ایستگاه را قبول می‌کند."}},"general":true,"patterns":["L1-jobs"],"often":{"pattern":"L1-jobs","n":7,"of":40,"label":{"en":"Comes up often in the real exam: 7 of the last 40 tests","tr":"Gerçek sınavda sık çıkar: son 40 sınavın 7’sinde","fa":"در آزمون واقعی زیاد می‌آید: در ۷ آزمون از ۴۰ آزمونِ اخیر"}}}]},"points":[{"eyebrow":{"en":"In the exam","tr":"Sınavda","fa":"در آزمون"},"head":{"en":"Notes, then a table, two limits","tr":"Notlar, sonra tablo, iki sınır","fa":"یادداشت، بعد جدول، دو سقف کلمه"},"body":{"en":"Questions 1-6 are notes: ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER. Questions 7-10 are a table: ONE WORD ONLY, so no figures there. Read both instructions carefully; the limit can change inside one part.","tr":"Soru 1-6 notlardır: ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER. Soru 7-10 bir tablodur: ONE WORD ONLY; yani orada rakam yok. İki talimatı da dikkatle oku; sınır aynı kısım içinde değişebilir.","fa":"سؤال‌های ۱ تا ۶ یادداشت‌اند: ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER. سؤال‌های ۷ تا ۱۰ جدول‌اند: ONE WORD ONLY، پس آن‌جا عدد نیست. هر دو دستور را دقیق بخوان؛ سقف کلمه ممکن است داخل یک بخش عوض شود."}},{"eyebrow":{"en":"The method","tr":"Yöntem","fa":"روش"},"head":{"en":"Four steps","tr":"Dört adım","fa":"چهار قدم"},"steps":[{"en":"Before you listen, circle the limit for each group and note which gaps need a number.","tr":"Dinlemeden önce her grubun sınırını daire içine al ve hangi boşlukların sayı istediğini not et.","fa":"قبل از گوش دادن، سقف کلمه‌ی هر گروه را دور کن و یادداشت کن کدام جاهای خالی عدد می‌خواهند."},{"en":"For the table, read across each row: the area name tells you when its answer is coming.","tr":"Tablo için her satırı yatay oku: bölüm adı cevabın ne zaman geleceğini söyler.","fa":"برای جدول هر ردیف را افقی بخوان: اسم بخش می‌گوید جوابش کی می‌آید."},{"en":"When a number is said, wait for \"no\", \"sorry\" or \"now\" before you write it.","tr":"Bir sayı söylendiğinde yazmadan önce \"no\", \"sorry\" ya da \"now\" gelecek mi diye bekle.","fa":"وقتی عددی گفته می‌شود، قبل از نوشتن صبر کن ببین «no»، «sorry» یا «now» می‌آید یا نه."},{"en":"Check plurals and spelling at the end; the table words are often plural nouns.","tr":"Sonda çoğulları ve yazımı kontrol et; tablo kelimeleri çoğu zaman çoğul isimlerdir.","fa":"آخر کار جمع‌ها و املا را چک کن؛ کلمه‌های جدول اغلب اسم جمع‌اند."}]},{"eyebrow":{"en":"The trap","tr":"Tuzak","fa":"دام"},"head":{"en":"The right figure for the right thing","tr":"Doğru şey için doğru rakam","fa":"عدد درست برای چیز درست"},"table":{"headers":{"en":["You hear","Gap","Write"],"tr":["Duyduğun","Boşluk","Yaz"],"fa":["می‌شنوی","جای خالی","بنویس"]},"rows":[["twenty per cent on books, but thirty on games","discount on games: ___ %","30"],["It was the 3rd... no, it’s the 5th now","start date: ___","5th"],["Not the side door. Use the main entrance.","enter by the ___ entrance","main"]]}}],"example":{"eyebrow":{"en":"Worked example","tr":"Çözümlü örnek","fa":"مثال حل‌شده"},"head":{"en":"One table gap, step by step","tr":"Bir tablo boşluğu, adım adım","fa":"یک جای خالی جدول، قدم به قدم"},"instruction":"Complete the table below. Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer.","item":"Warehouse · Main task: checking ___ when they arrive","lines":[["Supervisor","In the warehouse, you won’t need to lift anything heavy, the drivers do that. Your job is to check the deliveries when they come in, against the list on the screen."]],"answer":"deliveries","walk":[{"en":"Row: Warehouse. The gap needs a plural noun: things that arrive.","tr":"Satır: Warehouse. Boşluk çoğul bir isim istiyor: gelen şeyler.","fa":"ردیف: Warehouse. جای خالی یک اسم جمع می‌خواهد: چیزهایی که می‌رسند."},{"en":"Lifting is ruled out: \"you won’t need to... the drivers do that\".","tr":"Kaldırma işi eleniyor: \"...gerek kalmayacak, onu şoförler yapıyor\".","fa":"بلند کردن بار رد می‌شود: «لازم نیست... راننده‌ها این کار را می‌کنند»."},{"en":"\"Check the deliveries when they come in\": write deliveries, plural.","tr":"\"Teslimatları geldiklerinde kontrol et\": deliveries yaz, çoğul.","fa":"«تحویل‌ها را وقتی می‌رسند چک کن»: deliveries را بنویس، جمع."}]},"quick":{"prompt":"Table (ONE WORD ONLY): \"Breaks: ___ minutes in the morning\". Is this gap possible in a ONE WORD ONLY table?","options":["Yes: write 15","No: the answer would be a number","Yes: write fifteen minutes"],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"With ONE WORD ONLY, gaps never need a number, so the test would not ask this.","tr":"ONE WORD ONLY’de boşluklar asla sayı istemez; sınav bunu sormaz.","fa":"در ONE WORD ONLY جای خالی هیچ‌وقت عدد نمی‌خواهد، پس آزمون این را نمی‌پرسد."}},"remember":{"en":"Check the limit for each group, wait for the corrected figure, and match each figure to its item.","tr":"Her grubun sınırını kontrol et, düzeltilmiş rakamı bekle ve her rakamı kendi ürünüyle eşleştir.","fa":"سقف کلمه‌ی هر گروه را چک کن، منتظر عدد اصلاح‌شده بمان و هر عدد را با چیزِ خودش جور کن."},"type":"explain","id":"c-x10-l1-e","course":"ielts-exams","exam":"exam-10","unit":"x10-l1"},"drill":{"type":"drill","skill":"listening","part":"Listening Part 1","title":{"en":"First day at Larkhill Garden Centre","tr":"Larkhill Bahçe Merkezi’nde ilk gün","fa":"روز اول در مرکز باغبانی لارک‌هیل"},"timed":8,"ctx":["L1-jobs"],"script":[{"who":"Denise","line":"Morning! You must be Ollie. I'm Denise, the supervisor on the weekday shift. Welcome to Larkhill Garden Centre."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"Thanks. I'm a bit nervous, to be honest. It's my first proper job."},{"who":"Denise","line":"Don't worry, everyone's friendly here. Let's start with the practical things. Tomorrow, when you drive in, don't use the customer car park at the front. Staff park round the back, behind the big greenhouse."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"Behind the greenhouse. Got it."},{"who":"Denise","line":"Now, your locker. They're in the staff room, and they all have a code. Yours is number twelve, and the code is four, seven, one, nine. Oh, wait, no. Sorry, that's the old one. We changed all the codes last week. It's four, seven, nine, one now."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"Four, seven, nine, one. I'll put it in my phone."},{"who":"Denise","line":"Good idea. Then there's some paperwork to finish this morning. You've sent us your bank details already, haven't you?"},{"who":"Ollie","line":"Yes, last week."},{"who":"Denise","line":"Great. So the only other thing we need to see is your passport. We have to take a copy before you can be paid. A driving licence isn't enough on its own, I'm afraid."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"That's fine, I've got it with me."},{"who":"Denise","line":"Perfect. Your uniform is two green polo shirts, a fleece for cold days and an apron. You'll need your own boots, though. Any strong, waterproof ones will do. The uniform isn't in your locker yet; you collect it from our office manager, Pat Rowbotham."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"Sorry, how do you spell her surname?"},{"who":"Denise","line":"R-O-W-B-O-T-H-A-M. Her office is upstairs, above the café."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"OK. Do staff get a discount in the shop?"},{"who":"Denise","line":"Yes. It's ten per cent on most things, like tools and furniture, but on plants it's fifteen. And in the café you get a free hot drink on every shift."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"Nice. What about breaks?"},{"who":"Denise","line":"You get a fifteen-minute break mid-morning, and lunch is at half past twelve. If we're really busy, I might ask you to go at one instead, but that doesn't happen often."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"Half past twelve. That's earlier than I expected, but fine."},{"who":"Denise","line":"Now, I'll quickly explain the different areas, because you'll spend time in each of them over the first month."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"Right."},{"who":"Denise","line":"First, the outdoor plant area, which is the big space behind the main building. Your main job there will be watering, and that has to be done every morning, before the sun gets too strong. In the evening the ground stays wet for too long and the plants can get diseases."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"Mornings, then. What's next?"},{"who":"Denise","line":"Then there's aquatics, where we sell fish and pond equipment. That's inside, next to the café. The main task there is testing the water in the tanks. The fish are fed by a specialist, so you don't need to worry about that."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"Testing the water. And the café itself?"},{"who":"Denise","line":"Yes, you'll help in the café at busy times, especially weekends. You won't be cooking or serving, the kitchen staff do that. What we need is someone to clear and wipe the tables, because they fill up so fast at lunchtime."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"I can do that."},{"who":"Denise","line":"And finally, the tills, which are by the exit. You'll learn how to take payments, of course, but the thing new staff find hardest is refunds, so we'll spend a whole morning on those. People bring back plants that have died, and there are rules about what we can accept."},{"who":"Ollie","line":"I can imagine. Is there anyone I can ask if I'm not sure about something?"},{"who":"Denise","line":"Me, first of all. And there's a staff handbook in the staff room. Right, let's get you a coffee and start with the paperwork."}],"notes":{"title":"First day at Larkhill Garden Centre","headings":["Parking","Locker","Paperwork","Uniform","Staff discount","Breaks"]},"table":{"title":"Areas of the garden centre","headers":["Area","Location","Main task"],"rows":[["Outdoor plants","behind the main building","watering every (7) ___"],["Aquatics","inside, next to the (8) ___","testing the water in the tanks"],["Café","ground floor","clearing and wiping (9) ___"],["Tills","by the exit","learning to deal with (10) ___"]]},"groups":[{"instruction":"Questions 1-6. Complete the notes below. Write ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.","qtype":"note","questions":[{"n":1,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Parking · staff park behind the ___","accept":["greenhouse"],"limit":1,"evidence":"behind the big greenhouse","why":{"en":"Not the customer car park at the front: \"round the back, behind the big greenhouse\".","tr":"Öndeki müşteri otoparkı değil: \"arkada, büyük seranın arkasında\".","fa":"نه پارکینگ مشتری‌ها در جلو: «پشت ساختمان، پشت گلخانه‌ی بزرگ»."},"trap":["TR-paraphrase","TR-ruledout"]},{"n":2,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Locker · number 12, code: ___","accept":["4791"],"limit":1,"evidence":"It's four, seven, nine, one now","why":{"en":"4719 is the old code. \"We changed all the codes last week\": 4791.","tr":"4719 eski kod. \"Geçen hafta bütün kodları değiştirdik\": 4791.","fa":"۴۷۱۹ کد قدیمی است. «هفته‌ی پیش همه‌ی کدها را عوض کردیم»: ۴۷۹۱."},"trap":["TR-selfcorrect","TR-number"]},{"n":3,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Paperwork · show your ___ so that a copy can be taken","accept":["passport"],"limit":1,"evidence":"the only other thing we need to see is your passport","why":{"en":"Bank details are already sent, and a driving licence \"isn’t enough on its own\". They need the passport.","tr":"Banka bilgileri zaten gönderildi, ehliyet \"tek başına yetmez\". Pasaport gerekiyor.","fa":"مشخصات بانکی قبلاً فرستاده شده و گواهینامه «به‌تنهایی کافی نیست». پاسپورت لازم است."},"trap":["TR-ruledout"]},{"n":4,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Uniform · collect it from the office manager, Pat ___","accept":["Rowbotham"],"limit":1,"evidence":"R-O-W-B-O-T-H-A-M","why":{"en":"Spelled R-O-W-B-O-T-H-A-M: copy every letter, with a capital R.","tr":"R-O-W-B-O-T-H-A-M diye harf harf: her harfi büyük R ile kopyala.","fa":"حرف به حرف: R-O-W-B-O-T-H-A-M. همه‌ی حرف‌ها را با R بزرگ بنویس."},"trap":["TR-spell"]},{"n":5,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Staff discount · on plants: ___ %","accept":["15"],"limit":1,"evidence":"but on plants it's fifteen","why":{"en":"Ten per cent is for most things; plants get fifteen.","tr":"Çoğu şeyde yüzde on; bitkilerde on beş.","fa":"ده درصد برای بیشتر چیزهاست؛ برای گیاه پانزده."},"trap":["TR-price"]},{"n":6,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Breaks · lunch at ___","accept":["12.30","12:30"],"limit":1,"evidence":"lunch is at half past twelve","why":{"en":"\"Lunch is at half past twelve\"; one o’clock happens only when it is very busy.","tr":"\"Öğle yemeği on iki buçukta\"; saat bir yalnızca çok yoğun olunca.","fa":"«ناهار ساعت دوازده و نیم است»؛ ساعت یک فقط وقتی خیلی شلوغ باشد."},"trap":["TR-paraphrase"]}]},{"instruction":"Questions 7-10. Complete the table below. Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer.","qtype":"table","questions":[{"n":7,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Outdoor plants · Main task: watering every ___","accept":["morning"],"limit":1,"evidence":"that has to be done every morning","why":{"en":"\"Every morning, before the sun gets too strong\"; the evening is ruled out.","tr":"\"Her sabah, güneş fazla güçlenmeden\"; akşam eleniyor.","fa":"«هر صبح، قبل از اینکه آفتاب خیلی تند شود»؛ عصر رد می‌شود."},"trap":["TR-ruledout"]},{"n":8,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Aquatics · Location: inside, next to the ___","accept":["café","cafe"],"limit":1,"evidence":"That's inside, next to the café","why":{"en":"\"Inside, next to the café\".","tr":"\"İçeride, kafenin yanında\".","fa":"«داخل، کنار کافه»."},"trap":["TR-paraphrase"]},{"n":9,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Café · Main task: clearing and wiping ___","accept":["tables"],"limit":1,"evidence":"clear and wipe the tables","why":{"en":"Not cooking or serving: \"clear and wipe the tables\". Plural.","tr":"Yemek yapmak ya da servis değil: \"masaları toplamak ve silmek\". Çoğul.","fa":"نه آشپزی و نه سرو غذا: «جمع کردن و تمیز کردن میزها». جمع."},"trap":["TR-ruledout"]},{"n":10,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Tills · Main task: learning to deal with ___","accept":["refunds"],"limit":1,"evidence":"the thing new staff find hardest is refunds","why":{"en":"Taking payments is expected; \"the thing new staff find hardest is refunds\". Plural.","tr":"Ödeme almak beklenen şey; \"yeni personelin en zor bulduğu şey iadeler\". Çoğul.","fa":"گرفتن پول طبیعی است؛ «چیزی که برای کارکنان تازه از همه سخت‌تر است، پس دادن پول است». جمع."},"trap":["TR-paraphrase"]}]}],"audio":{"voices":{"Announcer":{"accent":"British (standard Southern)","gender":"M","tts":{"engine":"kokoro","voice":"bm_george"},"role":"Recorded rubric"},"Denise":{"accent":"Northern English","gender":"F","tts":{"engine":"piper","voice":"en_GB-southern_english_female-low","fallback":true,"note":"Northern English female wanted; no free Northern female voice yet"},"role":"Supervisor at a garden centre"},"Ollie":{"accent":"British (Southern English)","gender":"M","tts":{"engine":"kokoro","voice":"bm_fable"},"role":"New employee on his first day"}},"sequence":[{"type":"announcer","text":"Part 1. You will hear a supervisor talking to a new employee on his first day at a garden centre. First, you have some time to look at Questions 1 to 6."},{"type":"pause","seconds":30,"note":"reading time, Questions 1-6"},{"type":"announcer","text":"Now listen carefully and answer Questions 1 to 6."},{"type":"lines","from":0,"to":17,"note":"indoors, staff room: light background hum; no phone filter"},{"type":"announcer","text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at Questions 7 to 10."},{"type":"pause","seconds":30,"note":"reading time, Questions 7-10"},{"type":"announcer","text":"Now listen and answer Questions 7 to 10."},{"type":"lines","from":18,"to":28},{"type":"announcer","text":"That is the end of Part 1. You now have half a minute to check your answers.","after":30}]},"id":"c-x10-l1-d","course":"ielts-exams","exam":"exam-10","unit":"x10-l1"},"exit":{"type":"exit","items":[{"tests":"word","point":1,"prompt":"A supervisor says \"you’ll need your own boots\". This means boots are...","options":["not provided by the company","free for staff","sold in the staff room"],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"\"Your own\" = you must bring or buy them yourself.","tr":"\"Your own\" = kendin getirmeli ya da almalısın.","fa":"«your own» یعنی خودت باید بیاوری یا بخری."}},{"tests":"paraphrase","point":1,"prompt":"Notes say \"lunch at 1.15\". Which words in a recording mean the same time?","options":["a quarter to one","half past one","a quarter past one"],"correct":2,"why":{"en":"A quarter past one = 1.15. A quarter to one is 12.45.","tr":"A quarter past one = 1.15. A quarter to one ise 12.45.","fa":"a quarter past one یعنی ۱:۱۵. a quarter to one یعنی ۱۲:۴۵."}},{"tests":"trap","point":3,"prompt":"Gap: \"Door code: ___\". You hear: \"It’s two, eight, six, zero. No, hang on, that was last month. It’s two, eight, zero, six now.\" What do you write?","options":["2860","2806","28606"],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"The first code is corrected (\"that was last month\"); write the new one: 2806.","tr":"İlk kod düzeltiliyor (\"o geçen aydı\"); yenisini yaz: 2806.","fa":"رمز اول اصلاح می‌شود («آن مال ماه پیش بود»)؛ رمز تازه را بنویس: ۲۸۰۶."}},{"tests":"method","point":1,"prompt":"The notes say ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER, but the table says ONE WORD ONLY. What does this mean for the table?","options":["No answer in the table will be a number","You can write two words in the table","The table answers are all numbers"],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"ONE WORD ONLY means a single word and no figures.","tr":"ONE WORD ONLY tek bir kelime demek, rakam yok.","fa":"ONE WORD ONLY یعنی یک کلمه و بدون عدد."}},{"tests":"method","point":2,"prompt":"How do you know when the answer for the \"Tills\" row is coming?","options":["The speaker says \"Question 10\"","The speaker spells a word","The speaker names the area, \"the tills\""],"correct":2,"why":{"en":"The row name is your signpost; the speaker moves through the areas in order.","tr":"Satır adı yol gösterir; konuşan bölümleri sırayla anlatır.","fa":"اسم ردیف نشانه‌ی توست؛ گوینده بخش‌ها را به ترتیب می‌گوید."}}],"id":"c-x10-l1-x","course":"ielts-exams","exam":"exam-10","unit":"x10-l1"}}; })(globalThis.IELTS_EXAMS = globalThis.IELTS_EXAMS || {});
